# Delivery: test before done

Do **not** treat a lesson or player change as finished, and do **not** commit/push, until a real browser smoke test passes.

**Smoke 只是技術面下限。** 動到課文／插圖／音檔／quiz 的改動，交付前還必須過內容驗收（GATE 3）：`.cursor/skills/lesson-delivery-qa/SKILL.md` — fresh subagent 審故事邏輯與圖文契約、`python scripts/check_lesson_audio.py` 驗音檔、整課逐頁走查。交付單位是**整課**，不准生成單一圖片或音檔後就交卷。

`node --check` is not enough. This player is browser JS; a missing `let` only shows up as a console `ReferenceError` after the page loads.

## Minimum smoke (every lesson HTML you touched, plus `lesson-player.js` / `lesson.css`)

1. Serve the repo (`npx serve .` or existing local server). Do not rely on a stale tab.
2. Open `lessons/lesson-XX.html` (cover). Confirm the title, cover WebP, **Start**, **Go to**, and **Auto read** are visible.
3. Open DevTools console (or CDP). **Zero** errors on load.
4. **Go to** → Story 1: illustration appears (`.webp`, not `.png`).
5. **Go to** → Quiz: question + A/B/C; options disabled until Read; no console error.
6. If you changed Auto read / swipe / hash: spot-check `#story=2` and one swipe or Next.

If any step fails, fix and re-test. Only then commit/push when the user asked to publish.

## After publish

Hard-refresh **https://george.macau-tech.com/** (or local `npx serve .`) and repeat steps 2–3 on at least one lesson.
